Not covered by existing issues: #798/#992/#993/#1304/#1311 cover the relay/direct *network* paths and their deadlines/caps; #1645 covers the quota auth-file readers; the gated-read inventory in `lib/shared/DOCUMENTATION.md` has no row for this read (the APNs token *store* is a migrated durable store; this is the env-configured key file). `lib/notifications/DOCUMENTATION.md:85` documents `OPENCHAMBER_APNS_P8_PATH` as a supported configuration source.

