Probe: `~/git/fleet/probe-oc-guest-localzip-stat-20261106/probe.mjs` on the laptop, importing the real `installGuestFromPath` from main `8f61a0fd3f9849606a6d976b824431f2bd82ce36`. The probe patches only `fs/promises.stat` for the target zip path (the standard stat-lie seam used by the #1685/#1730 probes) so the gate sees a small regular file; every read is the module's own.

